# Bot1 draws the counter on the creature on the opponent's side of the table as it does on its own (a counter is public
# state), legibly as "1 x incubation".

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Drake Hatcher
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Drake Hatcher.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Drake Hatcher)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Client.Bot1.OpponentBattlefield.Drake Hatcher.Counters = 1 × incubation

